40
00:02:06.883 --> 00:02:28.180
Malis looks for minibeasts with a magnifying glass. A stick insect looks like a little stick! A centipede and a millipede have got lots of legs. A woodlouse hides under a log, and an earwig hides under a stone. Termites build tall mounds. Be careful: wasps and mosquitoes can sting and bite!

